    "body": "> @dholbert are you still planning on writing the specification for this?\n\nI had been planning to, but it slipped off my radar.  Having said that, I also don't think I've ever written a chunk of HTML spec text, so I imagine there'll be some process/tooling for me to learn.\n\nIf you'd be up for writing the spec text here, I'm happy to defer to you and review if needed. :)  It's probably fresher in your mind since it looks like you've been working on implementing it, and I think you're more familiar with the html-spec-editing-workflow.\n\nOr I can do it, but still might not get to it right away.",
